From 07937261b1f292b0bf20458e821cc86c71e95e6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: juniorverli <25966843+juniorverli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 11:17:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] ASoC: qcom: select speaker policy from parsed topology

Read the D26 policy and parsed AudioReach graph before WSA playback can
prepare. Keep the closed-loop guard when SP is present. Permit the public
graph only with the exact D26 marker, and fail closed when policy cannot be
read. Require successful PA, RX and MIX caps before speaker playback.

Signed-off-by: juniorverli <25966843+juniorverli@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 include/sound/sp11-guard.h      |   4 ++
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/topology.c |  65 ++++++++++++++++++-
 sound/soc/qcom/sp11-guard.c     |  62 +++++++++++++++++-
 sound/soc/qcom/x1e80100.c       | 111 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 4 files changed, 215 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

